      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While you make a good point, unfortunately vrc will not be willing to do this thanks to the actions of others. The reasons being 2 fold. \n1st: during the player surge of early 2018, many new and not so nice players would make crash avatars(or similar nuisance avatars) and while those accounts did get banned, they could easily make a new account upload the same avatar, and continue harassing the community. As such the ranking system was introduced along with a content gate to limit and prevent further actions by these people.\nSecondly, the concept of making you wait should be taken as an opportunity to learn how avatars/worlds in vrc are uploaded and how to optimize such assest.\nIn short, uploading content should be seen as a reward for participating in this community, and the avatar you wear is only there to ouwardly express who you are and that you are here to stay.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
